      "No one knows exactly when the room appeared. Some swear it has always existed in a recess of the central station, behind a corridor not shown on any map. Others say it emerges only for those who need it — between one door and another, when the wristwatch lags and the heart hurries ahead. The bronze plaque says only: Waiting Room.",
